  技术归纳总结、数据复盘与全资料标准化归档","Require":"1.英文口语流利，能熟练进行英语商务沟通；\n2.本科及以上学历，3年以上相关工作经验，电子硬件基础扎实，熟悉数电、模电基本知识。能独立读懂电控类完整原理图、PCB布局，熟悉电源、信号、功率驱动电路基础应用逻辑。\n3. 精通电子元器件电气参数、封装特性与工况应用，熟练BOM编制、物料替代评估， 具备企业内部新增物料料号申请、建档、台账管理实战经验 。\n4. 熟悉PCB全流程制造工艺及SMT生产过程，具备现场快速解决硬件突发异常的实操能力。\n5. 有测试板、工装测试类硬件设计相关项目从业经验者优先录用。\n6. 动手实操能力强，可独立完成故障排查、现场维修调试，具备现场技术兜底意识与能力。\n7. 具备优秀技术归纳、数据分析、问题复盘、全套资料分类归档的职业素养。\n8.  适配复合型跨专业项目场景，具备较强自主学习能力\n9.  工作积极主动，具备强烈的责任心与团队协同意识。\n10. 性格踏实严谨，闭环意识强，抗压能力优秀，能适配量产项目紧张节奏与多任务并行场景。","ClassificationOne":"工程技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-05T17:28:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"7e32bfde-71db-4a26-9fba-ecd1a097c87e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":621166660,"PostDateInt":1793849251000,"PostDate":"2026-11-05T11:27:31","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":